WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:04.225
Lab 1 runs on a laptop with
Chapter 1's inventory in place.

2
00:00:04.225 --> 00:00:06.709
First, Learn's script
against the stand-ins:

3
00:00:06.709 --> 00:00:11.606
read the test where all three application
permission removals come back not found,

4
00:00:11.606 --> 00:00:14.800
because the script named
the wrong service principal.

5
00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:19.563
Then list the permissions each task
needs, which match the table we just saw.

6
00:00:19.563 --> 00:00:24.115
Then run the sweep over a fictional
estate: eleven service principals,

7
00:00:24.115 --> 00:00:27.883
twenty grants, three handed to
the Privileged Access plan,

8
00:00:27.883 --> 00:00:30.474
and an owner review that isn't closed yet.

9
00:00:30.474 --> 00:00:34.270
Two agent identities are skipped,
because they're Chapter 9's.
